# Reason for retirement:
# - CV chose subject_weight=1 for both targets, which is the unchanged 1:1
#   subject/body representation.
# - Repeating the subject at 2:1, 3:1, and 4:1 reduced CV macro F1.
# - The final variant reached 73.90% queue accuracy, below the 74.27% baseline.
# - Its 75.61% priority accuracy was only 0.15 percentage points above baseline
#   and far below the active joint model's 80.26% priority accuracy.
